om2
global P uchar *
fn main to int
r = enlarge P ulong 8
k = kfdctl neg int 1 uint 2148027137 P 0 8
ret 0
end
note gate-pools: uses enlarge on purpose: owner=seed/host/hostpool/check.sh host-word pool admission fixture (a KFD word keeps refusing a pool)
note gate-pools: uses kfdctl on purpose: owner=seed/host/hostpool/check.sh a KFD word that keeps refusing a run-time pool operand (error 7); mutants devadmit and kfdadmit admit it
